        'ty_q7_q' => 'What is possible with the right detector?',
        'ty_q7_a' => 'The ceiling is higher than most people think. Customers have found nuggets, coins, and relics on ground others walked over for years.',
        'ty_q8_q' => 'Is it expensive?',
        'ty_q8_a' => 'Compare it to what staying stuck costs you every trip. A machine that separates gold from iron turns weekends into finds.',
        'ty_q9_q' => 'How long does shipping take?',
        'ty_q9_a' => 'We ship with tracking. Delivery is typically 5-10 business days depending on your location. Once dispatched, you get a tracking number to follow your order every step of the way.',
        'ty_q10_q' => 'Do you ship to my country?',
        'ty_q10_a' => 'We ship across Africa and internationally. If your country is not listed at checkout, message us before ordering — we almost always find a way to get the machine to you.',
        'ty_q11_q' => 'What payment methods do you accept?',
        'ty_q11_a' => 'Bank transfer, mobile money, and major card schemes. Details are provided when you confirm your order. All payments are secured and confirmed before dispatch.',
        'ty_q12_q' => 'Is there a warranty?',
        'ty_q12_a' => 'Yes. Every machine carries a manufacturer warranty against defects. If something goes wrong that is not caused by misuse or damage, we sort it out — no long-distance runaround.',
        'ty_q13_q' => 'What if the machine does not work for my ground?',
        'ty_q13_a' => 'Before you buy, we talk through your terrain, your targets, and your experience so you get the right setup. The how-where-why playbook also explains how to adjust the settings for your specific ground conditions.',
        'ty_q14_q' => 'Do you offer after-sales support?',
        'ty_q14_a' => 'Yes. The team that sells you the machine is the team that answers your calls afterward. Setup help, ground advice, and spare parts are all available after purchase.',
        'ty_q15_q' => 'Can I upgrade or trade in my old detector?',
        'ty_q15_a' => 'We do not run a formal trade-in programme, but if you are moving up from a basic machine, tell us what you have — we can part-exchange or give you an honest valuation to put toward the right setup.',
        'ty_q16_q' => 'What is the difference between your machines and a cheap detector?',
        'ty_q16_a' => 'Cheap machines find surface metal and dig trash. Our detectors tune out hot ground and junk, lock onto gold, and give you a signal you can trust. The difference shows on the first swing.',
        'ty_q17_q' => 'Is this suitable for beginners?',
        'ty_q17_a' => 'Absolutely. Every machine ships with a quick-start guide and a full how-where-why playbook. If you have never held a detector before, the setup is straightforward and the team is available to walk you through it.',
        'ty_q18_q' => 'Do I need any prior experience?',
        'ty_q18_a' => 'No. The machine and the playbook are designed to take you from your first outing to confident swing in a single session. Experience helps, but it is not required.',
        'ty_q19_q' => 'How deep can it detect?',
        'ty_q19_a' => 'Depth depends on ground conditions, target size, and settings. On typical African ground, our machines detect small nuggets at depths beginners are surprised by. The guide explains how to push deeper on your terrain.',
        'ty_q20_q' => 'Can it discriminate between gold and other metals?',
        'ty_q20_a' => 'Yes. Discrimination is the whole point. The machine separates gold-bearing targets from iron, slag, and trash so you spend your time digging finds, not bottle tops.',
        'ty_q21_q' => 'What happens if I damage the machine?',
        'ty_q21_a' => 'Accidents happen. If the damage is from normal field use, contact us first — we often repair rather than replace, and the cost is always less than a new machine. Wilful damage voids the warranty.',
        'ty_q22_q' => 'Do you provide training or a guide?',
        'ty_q22_a' => 'Every purchase includes the how-where-why playbook — written for the ground you are hunting, not generic instructions. If you want a live walkthrough before you buy, book a call and we will cover the key settings together.',
        'ty_q23_q' => 'Are spare parts available?',
        'ty_q23_a' => 'Yes. Coils, batteries, headphones, and carry bags are all stocked. If you need something specific, just ask — most parts ship within a few days.',
        'ty_q24_q' => 'How do I know which machine is right for me?',
        'ty_q24_a' => 'That is exactly what the pre-sale call is for. We ask about your ground, your budget, what you are looking to find, and your experience level. The right machine for a riverbank is not the right machine for a worked dump.',
